@MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5267

### 1. OpenAPI v1 Document
GET {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### 2. Author Self-Registration (IsApproved = false, Pending Admin Approval)
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/auth/Register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "FirstName": "Julian",
  "LastName": "Vance",
  "Email": "julian.vance@ledition.com",
  "Password": "Author@123",
  "ConfirmPassword": "Author@123",
  "Title": "Architectural Critic",
  "Bio": "Writes on brutalist geometry and Nordic interiors.",
  "PhotoUrl": null,
  "InstagramUrl": "https://instagram.com/julianvance",
  "TwitterUrl": null,
  "WebsiteUrl": "https://julianvance.com"
}

### 3. Author Sign-In (Sets author_access_token & author_refresh_token HttpOnly Cookies)
# @name authorLogin
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/auth/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "EmailOrSlug": "elena.rostova@ledition.com",
  "Password": "Admin@123"
}

###
@author_token = {{authorLogin.response.body.Data.AccessToken}}

### 4. Get Current Author Profile (/Me)
GET {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/auth/Me
Authorization: Bearer {{author_token}}

### 5. Refresh Author Session (Uses author_refresh_token HttpOnly Cookie + 30s Grace Period)
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/auth/Refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Update Current Author Profile
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/auth/UpdateProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{author_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "FirstName": "Elena",
  "LastName": "Rostova",
  "Email": "elena.rostova@ledition.com",
  "Title": "Senior Editor & Cultural Essayist",
  "Bio": "Elena Rostova writes on quiet luxury, minimalist aesthetics, and modern literature.",
  "PhotoUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb",
  "InstagramUrl": "https://instagram.com/elenarostova",
  "TwitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/elenarostova",
  "WebsiteUrl": "https://elenarostova.com"
}

### 7. Get Active Categories Dropdown List
GET {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/article-category/list
Authorization: Bearer {{author_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. List My Articles (Tbl_RequestArticle: Draft, Submitted, Approved, Rejected)
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/article/List
Authorization: Bearer {{author_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Page": 1,
  "PageSize": 20,
  "SearchKeyword": null,
  "ArticleCategoryId": null,
  "Status": null
}

### 9. Get My Article Detail (By RequestArticleId)
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/article/Detail
Authorization: Bearer {{author_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestArticleId": "01JREQ00000000000000000002"
}

### 10. Submit My Draft Article for Admin Review
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/article/SubmitForReview
Authorization: Bearer {{author_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestArticleId": "01JREQ00000000000000000002"
}

### 11. Delete My Article (Allowed While Status != Approved)
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/article/Delete
Authorization: Bearer {{author_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestArticleId": "01JREQ00000000000000000002"
}

### 12. Author Logout (Clears RefreshTokenHash & PreviousRefreshTokenHash + Deletes HttpOnly Cookies)
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/auth/Logout
Authorization: Bearer {{author_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
